                    insight_leader:         `Legitimate leader: you read the people, ran a structured method, found the route between betraying Aisha and deceiving the firm, delivered hard truth with care, and protected Thursday. You turned a 'stretch' promotion into earned authority — and bent Aurora's attrition curve down.`,
                    insight_complicit:      `Complicity: you concealed Aisha's likely departure from HR and the project owner. The deadline may look protected today, but you breached the Candour value on your own offer letter — and when they learn you knew, your credibility and the renewal both go.`,
                    insight_lostteam:       `You hit Thursday but lost the team. Optimising the visible £95k milestone while discarding a nine-year mentor cost you the trust of the people who deliver every future Thursday — the expensive cheap-looking decision.`,
